  <data name="txtDescription_Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>  If the projection coordinate system parameters of the original model are unavailable, you may use the 4-parameter Planar Transformation module to convert source coordinates to the target projection coordinate system, based on the Helmert 2D affine transformation model.
  Applicable Conditions: The source and target coordinate systems must share the same ellipsoid datum (e.g., both CGCS2000), and the conversion area should be limited to small-scale planar coordinates (recommended coverage &lt;50km²).</value>
